# Freedonia

id:world-freedonia a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "Freedonia" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/5f9dc012e4209> ;
    oa:editorialNote "---- the alphabetical sweep, G-H -----------------------------------------" ;
    oa:kind "planet" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "Around S Antliae — CD-28 7373, HD 82610, SAO 177619, HIP 46810, HR 3798 — which this map's catalogue carries under its numbers but under no name, at 259 ly in Antlia. The article gives no distance of its own, so there is nothing to check the star against. Held jointly by the Sophic League and the Non-Coercive Zone." ;
    oa:uncertain false .

